# Netlify redirects and proxies

# Proxy API to your backend on Render
/api/* https://shuspot.onrender.com/api/:splat 200

# Direct endpoint proxies for SPA that calls root-relative paths
/books https://shuspot.onrender.com/api/books 200
/books/* https://shuspot.onrender.com/api/books/:splat 200
/stats https://shuspot.onrender.com/api/stats 200
/upload-books https://shuspot.onrender.com/api/upload-books 200
/export/csv https://shuspot.onrender.com/api/export/csv 200
/books/bulk-update https://shuspot.onrender.com/api/books/bulk-update 200
/books/clear/all https://shuspot.onrender.com/api/books/clear/all 200

# SPA fallback
/* /index.html 200
